---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Lesser Heavens | Ray Weiss"
  description="Lesser Heavens. A fantasy 4X of faith and dominion. Early access on itch under Conflict Simulations LLC."
>
  <main class="doc">
    <div class="doc__frame">
      <header class="page-heading">
        <nav class="eyebrow" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/conflict-simulations-llc"
            >Conflict Simulations LLC</a
          >
        </nav>
        <h1>Lesser Heavens</h1>
        <p class="dek">A fantasy 4X of faith and dominion. Early access.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose-body">
        <p>
          You design a god, choose a people to raise, and spread its faith across a province map
          while rival gods do the same with their own magic. You order armies and watch the battles
          play out round by round, work world spells through your champions, and treat with rival
          peoples in Council.
        </p>
        <p>
          The world is drawn as an illuminated atlas: terrain, borders and belief sit on the map,
          not buried in menus. Four ways to win race you at once: outlast every rival god, take
          three Marks of the Ages, finish a Remaking at a Sanctum, or hold more than half the
          world's people in belief for ten turns.
        </p>
        <p>
          Three map sizes and three difficulties. Small runs hold about sixty land provinces; Large
          runs climb to a hundred and sixty with up to five rivals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="/images/games/lesser-heavens-cover.png"
          alt="Lesser Heavens cover: parchment title card with a gold-ringed emblem of a crowned castle over forest, desert and hills under a night sky"
          width="800"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Title card</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="prose-body terminal-section">
        <h2>Buy</h2>
        <p>
          Early access on itch under Conflict Simulations LLC at $6.99. Windows, macOS, browser.
          <a href="https://conflict-simulations-llc.itch.io/lesser-heavens"
            >conflict-simulations-llc.itch.io/lesser-heavens</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
